          "name": "Get the details of Team Workstreams to which the authenticated user (token user) has access.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get the details of Team Workstreams to which the authenticated user (token user) has access.",
            "description": {
              "content": "<strong>Note:</strong><br/>The use of a `Data-Admin` token will not return all Workstreams for all users.<br/>If no query string parameters are set, this will return Team Workstreams for Teams which the authenticated user (token user) is a member of. Personal Workstreams are not returned in the response.",
